      "content": "That feeling of emptiness when everything you've invested in disappears is completely understandable, but it is a temporary, overwhelming feeling, not a permanent truth. The person you were is still inside you, even if the external proof of their journey is gone. Reaching out to a professional counselor or therapist can provide a safe space to address this profound sense of loss and help you find a new direction. Please consider contacting a mental health resource to talk through this emptiness.",
